From d6f72c833f53acaa22c6fba6c64f803724735528 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 07:14:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ffi): add @cutils/ffi format-7 span ABI and Rust struct
 echo

Ship the shared scriptc FFI spec sqlite already uses (ffi_format 7,
length-delimited string/bytes, mutable-bytes out params, pointer as
bigint) plus layout helpers and a repr(C) EchoPoint smoke that compiles
to an ELF via scriptc 0.4.7.
